      "message": "Since iPhoneOS 3.1, the binaries can use a different format for the symbol stub section. This format stores stub offsets in single 4-byte instructions, leaving us with no space for embuing a RET instruction after the SVC, so instead we manually invoke a return after handling the SVC if we marked it with the ret flag. Together with the previous commit, this fixes the loading of 3.1+ apps.",
